16:9 (preferably 1280×720)images only
keep any text big because the image shows at only 280px wide
format: jpg and WebP under about 200 KB / use Squoosh to shrink its size
name it in lowercase with hyphens and no spaces, like episode-12.jpg

Use this block to add a new card on the carousel
<li>
  <a href="LINK" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
    <img src="assets/images/carousel/NAME.jpg" alt="WHAT THE IMAGE SHOWS">
  </a>
</li>

"LINK" for an episode: the YouTube video URL
"LINK" for a product or news: Delete target="_blank" rel="noopener" for these so it opens in the same tab.